/******************************************************************************/
/* Prose glyph lookup, modifiers, and the "=" catch (v167 redesign)          */
/* ----------------------------------------------------------------          */
/* A lone glyph inside {.rexx} colours by ProseSymbolTable lookup (no name);  */
/* five symbol modifiers disambiguate the ambiguous glyphs, "expression"      */
/* reads a fragment as an expression, and a bare "=" shouts a helpful error.  */
/******************************************************************************/

::Method test_glyph_multiply
  -- The former {.rexx-multiply} name is gone: the glyph itself is the API.
